{
  "preamble": "You are helping a developer on an Apple Silicon Mac. Reply with exactly one POSIX sh script in a single ```sh fenced block, then at most three sentences. The developer will run it with `sh` in macOS Terminal from the project directory, not inside a marsh shell. It must run unattended: no prompts and no interactive shell. Use only what the documentation says.",
